<card id="c" title="What&apos;s on My Raspberry Pi 5">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p>- <b>Power supply <a href="https://www.rs.galagomarket.com/item/display/3748">RASPBERRY PI 27W USB-C POWER SUPPLY, EU PLUG, WHITE</a>;</b></p>
<p>- <b>Official HDMI cable</b> <b><a href="https://www.rs.galagomarket.com/item/display/1865">MICRO-HDMI TO HDMI CABLE 1M, WHITE</a>;</b></p>
<p>- <b>Cooler <a href="https://www.rs.galagomarket.com/item/display/3751">ACTIVE COOLER</a></b> <i>(There is a built-in cooler in the case, but it&apos;s quite useless and very loud. This one is much quieter and more efficient).</i></p>
<p>The whole set cost 115 euros plus DHL shipping — 30 euros.</p>
<p>I paid the tax and the bill for the services of the company that processes the documents at the border.</p>
<p>In total, it came to around <b>170 euros</b>.</p>
<p>Thus, the total cost of the set was equivalent to 8.5 months of VDS rental.</p>
<p>So, what is it for?</p>
